        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 11904, Classic Mortise Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Classic Mortise Lockset has an attractive, traditional design that is accentuated by the 3 beautiful finishes in which it is available. Choose from polished brass, satin chrome, and satin nickel finishes. The Classic Mortise Entryset is available in a several lockable functions, so you'll be sure to find exactly what fits your application. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also available for standard pre-drilled doors: <a href=\"/products/classic-904-lever-entryset-omnia-d11904\">Omnia D11904</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classic Lever Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3 Hour</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.13.2005, Grade 1 Lock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 11904 Classic Lever Mortise Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1⁄2” b.s.: with 3-7⁄8” minimum stile</li>\r\n<li>2-3⁄4” b.s.: with 4-1⁄2” minimum stile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Solid brass curved lip strike.4-7⁄8” x 1-1⁄4” x lip 1-1⁄4” to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions and Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
