                "description": "The Classic Mortise Lockset has an attractive, traditional design that is accentuated by the 3 beautiful finishes in which it is available. Choose from polished brass, satin chrome, and satin nickel finishes. The Classic Mortise Entryset is available in a several lockable functions, so you'll be sure to find exactly what fits your application. \r\n",
